	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『スーパーロボット大戦OG』シリーズから、差し替えでマグナモードの再現が可能な「ガンレオン」が待望の商品化！",
			"• 各部の変形とパーツ差し替えでマグナモードを再現可能。",
			"• 機体の全長以上ある、長さ約230mmの「ライアット・ジャレンチ」ほか、豊富な武装が付属。",
			"• 「ライアット・ジャレンチ」は一部が展開し、マグナモードへの変形が可能。",
			"• 「ギーグ・ガン」は背部可変ブームへ、「デッカー・スパナ」は脚部への収納ができる。",
			"• 腰のレッド部にはジュエルシール、「チェイン・デカッター」側面のブラック・オレンジ部にはプラスチックシールを採用。",
			"• ポージングの幅を広げるアクションベース7が付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"From the \"Super Robot Wars OG\" series, the long-awaited \"Gunleon\" that can reproduce Magna Mode by replacing it has been commercialized!",
			"• Magna mode can be reproduced by deforming each part and replacing parts.",
			"• Comes with a wide range of weapons, including the \"Riot Jarenti\" with a length of about 230 mm, which is more than the total length of the aircraft.",
			"• \"Riot Jalench\" can be partially expanded and transformed into Magna mode.",
			"• The \"Gieg Gun\" can be stored on the variable boom on the back, and the \"Decker Spanner\" can be stored on the legs.",
			"• A jewel seal is used for the red part of the waist, and a plastic seal is used for the black and orange part on the side of the \"Chain Decutter\".",
			"• Comes with Action Base 7 to expand the range of posing."
		]
	},
